-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 2.0.0 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Rebuilt on Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks 6 with a Kirigami application, a System Settings module and a KAuth helper
  * Kept the sparky-ca command, the numbered text menu and the desktop entry name
  * Added a verified catalogue of ICP-Brasil certificates with pinned roots, ITI hashes and signed CRLs
  * Added installation in the system, Waterfox, Firefox and Chromium
  * Added A1 import, A3 token registration and optional KDE Wallet storage of passwords
  * Added a daily timer that keeps the chosen groups current and can be turned off
  * Added complete Brazilian Portuguese and Polish translations

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.2 (2018-03-29)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Changed sparky-xterm settings

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.1 (2018-02-19)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Added remsu to execute in desktop file

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2018-02-18)
